OL,5,
OL,6,FOne of the men was previously arrested
OL,7,Fon suspicion of money laundering in
OL,8,FJuly, along with another man in his 60s
OL,9,Fand a woman in her 50s. They were all
OL,10,Fbailed under investigation.
OL,12,FGMP said it was "exploring evidence
OL,13,Findicating over #1m worth of fraudulent
OL,14,Factivity" including 60 transactions and
OL,15,Fmore than a million emails.
